- * resource and is mapped non-exclusively on purpose (hardware-proven); there is no
- * MSI domain; the DLLLA timeout is non-fatal (enumeration is the final authority);
- * no endpoint driver has run.
+ * resource and is mapped non-exclusively on purpose (hardware-proven); no MSI has
